<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-013" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao" source-id="s-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0000" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2">歆</persName>有三子。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0005" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_A">表</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0007" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_A">偉容</persName>，年二十餘爲散騎侍郎。時同寮諸郎共平尚書事，年少，並兼厲鋒氣，要召名譽。尚書事至，或有不便，故遺漏不視，及傳書者去，即入深文論駮。惟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0075" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_A">表</persName>不然，事來有不便，輒與尚書共論盡其意，主者固執，不得已，然後共奏議。司空陳羣等以此稱之。仕晉，歷太子少傅、太常。稱疾致仕，拜光祿大夫。性清淡，常慮天下退理。司徒<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0156" ref="882_bd1_ca9">李胤</persName>、司隷<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0161" ref="pl3_syg_sxa">王弘</persName>等常稱曰：「若此人者，不可得而貴，不可得而賤，不可得而親，不可得而踈。」中子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0201" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_B">博</persName>，歷三縣內史，治有名跡。少子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:zi:m0216" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_C">周</persName>，黃門侍郎、常山太守，博學有文思。中年遇疾，終于家。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:heir" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:heir:m0000" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_A">表</persName>有三子。長子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:heir:m0007" ref="418_c91_b6b">廙</persName>，字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huabiao:heir:m0010" ref="418_c91_b6b">長駿</persName>。</p>
</text>
